      ],
      "source": "https://lattesandrunways.com/guide-to-streeterville/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood hosts the National Historic Landmark Jean Baptiste Point Du Sable Homesite, the first non‑Native home in Chicago.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
