      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Streeterville"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Silt and sand accumulated north of the pier, creating the reclaimed land now known as “The Sands.”.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Streeterville"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Streeterville contains the only three five‑star hotels in the Midwest: the Ritz‑Carlton, Peninsula, and Four Seasons.",
